id: pm-rlm-alp8
title: Verify SDK adoption boundaries for recursive run ownership and scoped reads
description: "Address both unused SDK findings from the 2026-10-25 audit: adopt process-start-aware SDK leases with safe long-call lifetime and checkpoint fencing; preserve immutable consent-scoped exact filters unless an equivalent SDK API exists. Prove parity on public tracker copies, verify history after primed caches, retain full coverage and npm/Bun release gates."
type: Task
status: open
priority: 2
tags: []
