parent: pm-rlm-a1ih
comments[11]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-25T18:04:58.970Z",codex-agent,"Orientation: searched SDK, adoption, adopt and reuse; no existing SDK-adoption item found. Related delivered SDK ledger item: pm-rlm-6a8t; parent pm-rlm-a1ih. Audit ledger.ts:240-269 cannot be replaced under the pinned dependency policy: @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.10.20 exports acquireLock but not acquireLockLease or LockLease.fence (confirmed declarations and runtime namespace). The current 2026.10.25 host has the API, but importing it from the host or bumping the pin would violate the queue rules. Missing pinned SDK APIs: acquireLockLease and LockLease.fence. Retain the current runtime owner until a dependency update; any later adoption needs a long-model-call lifetime policy and fencing at publication, not a short TTL substitution."
  "2026-10-25T18:05:04.671Z",codex-agent,"Audit environment.ts:20-28 retained deliberately: matches evaluates an immutable consent-scoped snapshot with exact string predicates. parseMultiValueFilter accepts a comma/OR grammar and cannot preserve that behavior; a live PmClient list would bypass the frozen source boundary. Missing equivalent SDK API: a pure predicate evaluator over caller-owned frozen item snapshots with exact literal type/status/parent/tag strings and the current full-item text semantics. No dependency bump or grammar expansion authorized. Verification plan: public tracker origin/main build versus candidate build, read-only non-git copies, real SDK cache priming followed by history corruption, targeted regressions and unchanged 100-percent coverage gates."
  "2026-10-25T18:08:45.405Z",codex-agent,"Clarification on the filter disposition: the audit explicitly recommends preserving snapshot isolation. No new core API defect is claimed for exact frozen-snapshot predicates; parseMultiValueFilter is available but is a different comma/OR input contract. Zero replacements and zero deleted production lines. Both findings are dispositioned here; SDK lease adoption awaits the dependency update policy, and PID-only ownership remains a known risk."
  "2026-10-25T18:10:11.248Z",codex-agent,"Evidence: node --test test/sdk-boundaries.test.ts passes 3/3, including real SDK event-cache priming then same-size valid-JSON history corruption with the original mtime restored; history refuses without charging budget and GC refuses without deleting its orphan. New regressions also run with a Git discovery ceiling and no git executable. node test/sdk-boundaries-revert.ts passes 3/3 independent behavioral probes: removing authoritative history verification, removing pre-sweep verification, and widening the literal type filter each causes its targeted assertion to fail; sources restored byte-for-byte. Replacement revert proofs: not applicable (zero replacements)."
  "2026-10-25T18:10:14.666Z",codex-agent,"Differential proof: node test/sdk-boundaries-public.ts builds origin/main e8315c0 and the candidate, compares 13 complete outputs per tracker on public pm-rlm (22 items, 50 files) and pm-lint f2c20ef (12 items, 30 files). All 26 comparisons identical, including receipts/token charges; no intentional differences. Sources are file/directory read-only, all paths and bytes unchanged, workers have no git executable and run outside git. Ownership cases use separate disposable writable ledgers. npm run typecheck, npm run lint and npm run duplication pass; duplication is zero. See docs/SDK-ADOPTION.md and docs/sdk-adoption-validation.json."
  "2026-10-25T18:11:18.296Z",codex-agent,"Local linked-test execution via pm test --run --progress passes 1/1 linked command with 3/3 assertions-based tests. Health with isolated HOME and system/global Git config disabled passes strict-exit and required merge drivers. Normal HOME health reports local extension_host_pm_cli_version_skew between pinned host 2026.10.20 and globally installed pm-github 2026.10.25; no extension configuration changed. Full-gate evidence will come from clean CI on the published head. The peer range also includes older SDKs, so future lease adoption must establish a supported minimum host version as well as updating the development pin."
  "2026-10-25T18:15:36.827Z",codex-agent,"PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rlm/pull/27 is ready for review. Initial CI 40220113100 correctly rejected the proof worker because clean typecheck precedes build and its imports referenced generated dist files. Fixed worker imports to source, then compile it separately for each differential arm. Revalidated typecheck in a clean archive with no dist directory; reran all 26 differential comparisons unchanged, plus typecheck, lint and zero-duplication gates. Corruption fixtures now normalize timestamps before cache priming and assert exact mtimeMs and size preservation after tampering. Targeted regressions still pass 3/3. Production code remains unchanged; full npm/Bun CI evidence will be linked in the PR."
  "2026-10-25T18:19:28.123Z",codex-agent,"Implementation and proof work is ready for owner review at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rlm/pull/27. Disposition remains 0 replaced / 2 retained / 0 production lines deleted. All 26 public comparisons, 3 focused regressions and 3 behavioral guard probes pass; clean-archive typecheck, lint, duplication, docstring and changelog checks pass. Full coverage and npm/Bun release gates are still running and are not yet claimed as passing. The final CI run and exact counts will be retained in the linked PR validation section and checks at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rlm/actions/workflows/ci.yml. Automated review is not approval: Sourcery is quota-limited, CodeRabbit did not run automatically, and cubic is neutral. Releasing the claim for review; item remains in_progress for the orchestrator. No merge or release performed."
  "2026-10-25T18:28:03.951Z",codex-agent,"Full coverage run measured 100 percent for statements, branches, functions and lines, but the suite was not passing: 249/250 tests passed because the shallow-clone proof inventory expected exactly 11 scripts and this change adds the twelfth. Updating that inventory to require the new script and adding its standard 3/3 revert-proof summary so the existing depth-one harness actually executes and checks it. No production source or coverage threshold changed. Reclaimed briefly for this test-harness correction; prior failed or superseded CI runs are not passing evidence."
  "2026-10-26T08:21:27.363Z",codex-agent,"Verified current main contains merged PR #27 (https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rlm/pull/27), merge commit 6ee1966cbe78d84080335b0d9235f0d365b8a44e, merged_at 2026-10-25T19:04:17Z. Inspected src/ledger.ts, src/environment.ts, test/sdk-boundaries.test.ts and docs/SDK-ADOPTION.md. Partial delivery: non-git differential and primed-cache integrity guards are delivered, but process-start-aware SDK lease adoption and publication fencing are not. Pinned SDK 2026.10.20 lacks acquireLockLease and LockLease.fence. Remaining work needs a supported dependency update, safe long-model-call lifetime and checkpoint fencing, then ownership regressions. Exact predicates over immutable consent-scoped snapshots remain required; no live-list or comma/OR substitution is accepted. Plan: run the linked focused verification on unchanged main sources; append only tracker evidence, regenerate the repository changelog and submit a closure PR for full CI."
  "2026-10-26T08:26:57.784Z",codex-agent,"Verified current main contains merged PR #27 (https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rlm/pull/27), merge commit 6ee1966cbe78d84080335b0d9235f0d365b8a44e, merged_at 2026-10-25T19:04:17Z. Inspected src/ledger.ts, src/environment.ts, test/sdk-boundaries.test.ts and docs/SDK-ADOPTION.md. Partial delivery: non-git differential and primed-cache integrity guards are delivered, but process-start-aware SDK lease adoption and publication fencing are not. Pinned SDK 2026.10.20 lacks acquireLockLease and LockLease.fence. Remaining work needs a supported dependency update, safe long-model-call lifetime and checkpoint fencing, then ownership regressions. Exact predicates over immutable consent-scoped snapshots remain required; no live-list or comma/OR substitution is accepted. Linked focused verification passed: npm run build && node --test test/sdk-boundaries.test.ts. No product source behavior changed in this closure branch. Full npm and Bun release gates are reserved for CI; no new behavioral revert applies to tracker-only changes."
